  3
PERFORMANCE NOTES\P1  Rooms face N and S only: mean incident solar 937 kWh/m².yr vs 1455 if turned to E/W (clear-sky).\P2  South balcony 1.50 m = overhang + terracotta side fins: blocks 87% of annual beam sun (100% Mar-May).\P3  North fins 0.20 m at 
  3
1.05 m pitch + 0.60 m sunshade: 87% beam blocked (sunshade alone 59%).\P4  Cores at the E/W ends are thermal buffers behind a living wall (W) and terracotta jaali (E).\P5  Galleries open onto the atrium and are not air-conditioned; atrium ~14 ACH by 
  1
stack effect at dT 2 K.\PKeys this floor: 26 (24 Deluxe King 37.8 m² + 2 Corner Junior Suites). Floors L03-L09.
